---
const GH = 'https://github.com/GustavoPenaBeltrami/self-learning-platform';
---
<header class="cover">
  <div class="cover-top"><span>your agent, your teacher</span><span>open source · MIT</span></div>
  <div class="cover-hero">
    <img src="/app/assets/lockup-horizontal.png" alt="独学 Self Learning Platform" width="2816" height="1536" fetchpriority="high">
    <p class="lede">A teacher for everything you study alone. It finds your level, explains, grades your work and remembers what you got wrong. You do the learning.</p>
    <div class="btns">
      <a class="btn primary" href="#start">get started</a>
      <a class="btn" href={GH}>view on github</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="meta">
    <div><div></div><div>SLP · Self Learning Platform</div></div>
    <div><div></div><div>独学 · dokugaku</div></div>
    <div><div></div><div>A teacher for people who study alone</div></div>
  </div>
</header>
